    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "As built today", "items": ["Ingress, scheduler, router, supervisor, watchdog and recovery are implemented and covered by tests", "The journal and the EdgeRecord port are two durability layers already", "Both the native and the OpenAI ingress produce the same InferenceJob"] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "Proposed for v1.0", "items": ["A control plane elects one leader so two brokers cannot double-dispatch", "The shared queue survives a broker restart instead of living in memory", "The EdgeRecord adapter becomes a real client rather than a generic HTTP port"] },
